{"id":"cb8a48b22f04693d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-prop-measurable-definition.md","title":"Measurable Definition","display":"prop-measurable-definition — Measurable Definition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-measurable-definition","aliases":["58-prop-measurable-definition"],"display":"prop-measurable-definition — Measurable Definition","depends_on":["[[58-df-measurable-cardinal]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-measurable-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-measurable-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-measurable-definition — Measurable Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"58-df-measurable-cardinal\">58-df-measurable-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (不可数基数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (可测基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"58-df-measurable-cardinal\">58-df-measurable-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (超滤谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}definition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}definition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This proposition unfolds <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"58-df-measurable-cardinal\">58-df-measurable-cardinal</a> without introducing unattached completeness or nonprincipality predicates.</li>\n<li>The intersection operator is applied only to nonempty families, exactly as in the upstream definition; the empty-family case is already supplied by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in U\">\\(\\kappa\\in U\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Measurable cardinals are strong large cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (可测基数谓词, see [[58-df-measurable-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (基数谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S$ (超滤谓词, see [[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This proposition unfolds [[58-df-measurable-cardinal]] without introducing unattached completeness or nonprincipality predicates.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}definition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\n\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in U","display":false}],"bytes":1517,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3980","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-prop-measurable-definition.md|58-prop-measurable-definition]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["b4fb7c1808c84d14","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}